> Module Hsa

> Using Types
> Using Params_2024 as P
> Using Rounding as R

# Health savings accounts: Form 8889 lines 1 to 16 and the Schedule 1 deduction

Direct File module `hsa.xml` ("DF" below,
`../direct-file/direct-file/backend/src/main/resources/tax/hsa.xml`, 4,064
lines). Issue #35, scope.md section 3.6. Law: 26 U.S.C. § 223
(`sources/statute/irc-223.html`), Rev. Proc. 2023-23 section 3.04
(`sources/revproc/rp-23-23.pdf` p 2), Form 8889 (2024)
(`sources/forms-instructions/f8889--2024.pdf` p 1) and its instructions
(`sources/forms-instructions/i8889--2024.pdf`). Tests are in
`catala/tests/test_hsa.catala_en`; the oracle comparison is
`difftest/mappings/hsa.mjs`.

## What this module computes, and what it leaves out

- Form 8889 Part I lines 1 to 13 and Part II lines 14a to 16, for the primary
  filer and, on a joint return, the secondary filer (a separate form each).
  Output `hsa_total_deductible_amount` (DF `/hsaTotalDeductibleAmount`) is the
  sum of the two line 13 amounts and feeds Schedule 1 line 13 and Form 1040
  line 10 (`Form1040.hsa_total_deductible_amount`).
- Part III (last-month rule, line 18 to 21), Archer MSA (line 4), qualified
  HSA funding distributions (line 10) and the additional 20% tax (line 17) are
  not computed. Line 4 and line 10 are `$0` and each case that would make them
  non-zero is a knockout (`ko_hsa_medical_savings_account_type`,
  `ko_made_qualified_hsa_funding_distribution`,
  `ko_hsa_testing_period_additional_income_yes`).
- Every DF knockout fact of `hsa.xml` is a `ko_` condition (CONVENTIONS
  section 6). `unsupported` lists the 19 that `flow.xml` lines 77 to 95 feed
  into `/flowIsKnockedOut`, plus two block-submission validations of
  `hsa.xml` (a distribution of a filer who reported no HSA activity, and a
  distribution of the secondary filer on a return that is not joint).
  Issue #36 aggregates `unsupported` into the return.
- The inputs are complete (CONVENTIONS section 3). DF's `hasCompleted...` and
  `...SectionIsComplete` facts only track questionnaire progress and are not
  modelled; in particular the over-limit knockout
  (`causesHsaContributionsOverLimitKnockout`) is gated in DF on the
  contributions section being complete, which is always true here.
- Wiring (done by the orchestrator, not here): `Filers` supplies
  `is_filing_status_mfj`, `is_married`, `is_single`, the two ages (55 or
  older) and `can_be_claimed`; `FormW2s` supplies
  `primary_filer_total_hsa_contributions_from_w2s`,
  `secondary_filer_total_hsa_contributions_from_w2s` and the two `has_...`
  conditions; `Form1040` supplies `ko_knockout_has_no_payments_or_credits`,
  `paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year`, tax exempt interest, line 5a and
  line 6a. The output feeds `Form1040.hsa_total_deductible_amount`.

Facts DF keeps per filer (`/filers/*`) are variables here that take a
`Types.FilerRole` (`depends on role`); `primary_filer` and `secondary_filer`
hold the writable answers of the two `/filers` entries.

## Declarations

```catala-metadata
## Medicare enrollment during the tax year. DF: hsa.xml
## /enrolledInMedicareOptions.
declaration enumeration MedicareEnrollment:
  -- MedicareAllYear
  -- MedicarePartOfYear
  -- MedicareNoneOfYear

## HDHP coverage during the tax year. DF: hsa.xml /hsaHdhpCoverageStatusOptions.
declaration enumeration HdhpCoverageStatus:
  -- HdhpAllYear
  -- HdhpPartOfYear
  -- HdhpNoneOfYear

## Type of HDHP coverage. DF: hsa.xml /typeOfHdhpOptions.
declaration enumeration TypeOfHdhp:
  -- SelfOnly
  -- Family
  -- BothSelfAndFamily

## Other health coverage that disqualifies from HSA contributions. DF: hsa.xml
## /hadOtherCoverageIneligibleForHSAOptions.
declaration enumeration OtherCoverageIneligible:
  -- OtherCoverageWholeYear
  -- OtherCoveragePartOfYear
  -- OtherCoverageNoneOfYear

## Change in marital status during the tax year. DF: hsa.xml
## /changeInMaritalStatusDuringTaxYearOptions.
declaration enumeration MaritalStatusChange:
  -- WasMarriedOrDivorcedThisYear
  -- WasNotMarriedNorDivorcedThisYear

## Form 1099-SA box 3. DF: hsa.xml /hsaDistributionCodeOptions.
declaration enumeration HsaDistributionCode:
  -- NormalDistribution
  -- ExcessContributions
  -- Disability
  -- DeathOtherThanCode6
  -- ProhibitedTransaction
  -- DeathDistributionAfterYear

## The writable HSA answers DF keeps per filer (collection `/filers`). An
## answer the questionnaire does not ask for a filer (for example the
## coverage answers of a filer without contributions) still has a value; DF
## reads it only where the rules below read it.
declaration structure HsaFilerAnswers:
  # DF: /filers/*/writablePrimaryFilerHasMadeContributionsToHsa
  data writable_primary_filer_has_made_contributions_to_hsa content boolean
  # DF: /filers/*/writableSecondaryFilerHasMadeContributionsToHsa
  data writable_secondary_filer_has_made_contributions_to_hsa content boolean
  # DF: /filers/*/enrolledInMedicare
  data enrolled_in_medicare content MedicareEnrollment
  # DF: /filers/*/hsaHdhpCoverageStatus
  data hsa_hdhp_coverage_status content HdhpCoverageStatus
  # DF: /filers/*/typeOfHdhp
  data type_of_hdhp content TypeOfHdhp
  # DF: /filers/*/hadOtherCoverageIneligibleForHSA
  data had_other_coverage_ineligible_for_hsa content OtherCoverageIneligible
  # DF: /filers/*/writableMfsLine6Check
  data writable_mfs_line6_check content boolean
  # DF: /filers/*/writableChangeInMaritalStatusDuringTaxYear
  data writable_change_in_marital_status_during_tax_year
    content MaritalStatusChange
  # DF: /filers/*/writableMaritalChangeAffectContributionLimitBool
  data writable_marital_change_affect_contribution_limit_bool content boolean
  # DF: /filers/*/hasMadeQualifiedHsaFundingDistribution
  data has_made_qualified_hsa_funding_distribution content boolean
  # DF: /filers/*/writableHsaNonemployerContributionsTaxYear
  data writable_hsa_nonemployer_contributions_tax_year content money
  # DF: /filers/*/writableHsaNonemployerContributionsTaxYearPlusOne
  # (contributions for the tax year made by the unextended due date, Form 8889
  # instructions line 2)
  data writable_hsa_nonemployer_contributions_tax_year_plus_one content money

## One Form 1099-SA. DF: collection `/hsaDistributions`.
declaration structure HsaDistribution:
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/filer
  data filer content Types.FilerRole
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableDistributionsRolloverBool
  data writable_distributions_rollover_bool content boolean
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableDistributionsRolloverAmount
  data writable_distributions_rollover_amount content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableGrossDistribution (1099-SA box 1)
  data writable_gross_distribution content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/hasWithdrawnExcessContributions
  data has_withdrawn_excess_contributions content boolean
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableWithdrawnExcessContributionsAmount
  data writable_withdrawn_excess_contributions_amount content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableEarningsOnExcessContributions (box 2)
  data writable_earnings_on_excess_contributions content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/hsaDistributionCode (box 3)
  data hsa_distribution_code content HsaDistributionCode
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableFmvOnDateOfDeath (box 4)
  data writable_fmv_on_date_of_death content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableQualifiedMedExpenses
  data writable_qualified_med_expenses content money

## The derived facts of one 1099-SA.
declaration scope HsaDistributionItem:
  input distribution content HsaDistribution
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/distributionsRolloverAmount
  output distributions_rollover_amount content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/withdrawnExcessContributionsAmount
  output withdrawn_excess_contributions_amount content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/modifiedDistribution
  output modified_distribution content money
  output filer content Types.FilerRole
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableGrossDistribution
  output gross_distribution content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/writableQualifiedMedExpenses
  output qualified_med_expenses content money
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/causesEarningsOnExcessContributionsKO (box 2 > $0)
  output has_earnings_on_excess_contributions condition
  # DF: /filers/*/hsaDistributionNotNormalKnockout (box 3 is not code 1)
  output code_is_not_normal condition
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/causesFmvKnockout (box 4 > $0)
  output has_fmv_on_date_of_death condition
  # DF: /hsaDistributions/*/causesUnqualifiedDistributionsKnockout
  output has_unqualified_distribution condition

## The lines of one Form 8889 (Parts I and II) that the module computes.
declaration structure Form8889:
  # Line 1 check boxes
  data line_1_family content boolean
  data line_1_self_only content boolean
  # Line 2
  data line_2 content money
  # Line 3
  data line_3 content money
  # Line 5 (line 4, Archer MSA, is $0)
  data line_5 content money
  data line_6 content money
  data line_7 content money
  data line_8 content money
  data line_9 content money
  data line_11 content money
  data line_12 content money
  data line_13 content money
  data line_14a content money
  data line_14b content money
  data line_14c content money
  data line_15 content money
  data line_16 content money

declaration scope Hsa:
  # ---- Inputs from other modules (see the wiring note above)
  # DF: filingStatus.xml /isFilingStatusMFJ
  input is_filing_status_mfj condition
  # DF: filers.xml /isMarried
  input is_married condition
  # DF: filers.xml /isSingle
  input is_single condition
  # DF: filers.xml /filers/*/age55OrOlder
  input primary_filer_age55_or_older condition
  input secondary_filer_age55_or_older condition
  # DF: filers.xml /filers/*/canBeClaimed
  input primary_filer_can_be_claimed condition
  input secondary_filer_can_be_claimed condition
  # DF: formW2s.xml /primaryFilerTotalHsaContributionsFromW2s, W-2 box 12 W
  input primary_filer_total_hsa_contributions_from_w2s content money
  input secondary_filer_total_hsa_contributions_from_w2s content money
  # DF: formW2s.xml /hasPrimaryFilerHsaContributionsFromW2s
  input has_primary_filer_hsa_contributions_from_w2s condition
  input has_secondary_filer_hsa_contributions_from_w2s condition
  # DF: taxCalculations.xml /knockoutHasNoPaymentsOrCredits
  input knockout_has_no_payments_or_credits condition
  # DF: estimatedPayments.xml /paidEstimatedTaxesOrFromLastYear
  input paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year condition
  # DF: interest.xml /taxExemptInterest
  input tax_exempt_interest content money
  # DF: income.xml /pensionsAndAnnuities (Form 1040 line 5a)
  input pensions_and_annuities content money
  # DF: socialSecurity.xml /socialSecurityBenefits (Form 1040 line 6a)
  input social_security_benefits content money

  # ---- Writable facts of hsa.xml
  input primary_filer content HsaFilerAnswers
  input secondary_filer content HsaFilerAnswers
  # DF: /someFilerHadNonW2HsaActivity
  input some_filer_had_non_w2_hsa_activity content boolean
  # DF: /writablePrimaryFilerHadNonW2HsaActivity
  input writable_primary_filer_had_non_w2_hsa_activity content boolean
  # DF: /writableSecondaryFilerHadNonW2HsaActivity
  input writable_secondary_filer_had_non_w2_hsa_activity content boolean
  # DF: /hasHsaMedicalSavingsAccountType
  input has_hsa_medical_savings_account_type content boolean
  # DF: /writableHasHsaExcessContributionsPreviousYear
  input writable_has_hsa_excess_contributions_previous_year content boolean
  # DF: /writableHasHsaWithdrawnExcessContributionsYesNo
  input writable_has_hsa_withdrawn_excess_contributions_yes_no content boolean
  # DF: /someFilersMadeTestingPeriodContribution
  input some_filers_made_testing_period_contribution content boolean
  # DF: /someFilersHaveTestingPeriodAdditionalIncome
  input some_filers_have_testing_period_additional_income content boolean
  # DF: /hsaDistributions
  input hsa_distributions content list of HsaDistribution

  # ---- Helpers
  internal answers content HsaFilerAnswers depends on role content Types.FilerRole
  internal is_primary content boolean depends on role content Types.FilerRole
  internal is_secondary content boolean depends on role content Types.FilerRole
  internal age55_or_older content boolean depends on role content Types.FilerRole
  internal can_be_claimed content boolean depends on role content Types.FilerRole
  internal items content list of HsaDistributionItem

  # ---- Intro screens: who may have HSA activity
  # DF: /flowShowHsaYesNo
  internal flow_show_hsa_yes_no content boolean
  # DF: /someFilerHadNonEmployerHsaActivity
  internal some_filer_had_non_employer_hsa_activity content boolean
  # DF: /flowShowHsaPrimaryYesNo
  internal flow_show_hsa_primary_yes_no content boolean
  # DF: /primaryFilerHadNonW2HsaActivity
  internal primary_filer_had_non_w2_hsa_activity content boolean
  # DF: /flowShowHsaSecondaryYesNo
  internal flow_show_hsa_secondary_yes_no content boolean
  # DF: /secondaryFilerHadNonW2HsaActivity
